      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Manchester_Center,_Vermont"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Southern Vermont Arts Center in Manchester Center has hosted visual and performing arts programs since 1922.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
